* TPN2R304PL (Toshiba, 40 V 2.3 mOhm N-MOSFET, TSON Advance)
* VDMOS fit to datasheet Rev 3.0 by aio-3in/v1/sim/fet_model/run.py.
* NOT Toshiba's model.  Nodes: D G S.  Internal: di gi si (die).
* rg = RG param (datasheet 0.5 typ, 1.0 max); package L estimated.
* TT = body-diode transit time (stored charge = TT x IF): 1.5 ns default,
* see sim/README.md on why this is the least certain parameter.

.subckt TPN2R304PL_25C D G S params: RG=0.7 TT=1.5e-09
Ld D di 0.15n
Lg G gx 0.5n
Rgi gx gi {RG}
Ls si S 0.25n
M1 di gi si QCORE_25C
.model QCORE_25C VDMOS (vto=2.85 kp=190 lambda=0.003 ksubthres=0.2 rd=0.0009139 rs=0.00015 cgs=2.571e-09 cgdmax=1.058e-09 cgdmin=1e-11 a=0.2593 cjo=2.353e-09 m=0.5751 vj=2.251 is=4.6e-10 n=1.25 rb=0.0005 tt={TT})
.ends

.subckt TPN2R304PL_100C D G S params: RG=0.7 TT=1.5e-09
