Rgi gx gi {RG}
Ls si S 0.25n
M1 di gi si QCORE_100C
.model QCORE_100C VDMOS (vto=2.45 kp=135.7 lambda=0.003 ksubthres=0.2 rd=0.001304 rs=0.00015 cgs=2.571e-09 cgdmax=1.058e-09 cgdmin=1e-11 a=0.2593 cjo=2.353e-09 m=0.5751 vj=2.251 is=4.6e-10 n=1.25 rb=0.0005 tt={TT})
.ends

